Feature: Calculate month-wise shipment statistics

  Background:
    Given the Unity Catalog is configured as purgo_databricks
    And the Unity Catalog Schema is purgo_playground
    And tables purgo_playground.shipments and purgo_playground.clients are available

  Scenario: Calculate shipment metrics per client per year and month
    Given a user wants to calculate monthly shipment statistics
    When the shipments data is processed to extract the year and month from shipment_date
    And the data is grouped by client_id, year, and month
    And total shipments and cancelled shipments are calculated per client
    And the data is joined with clients table on client_id
    Then select client_name, year, month, total_shipments, cancelled_shipments, and cancellation_percentage

  Scenario: Handle null or incorrect shipment dates
    Given shipment_date can be null or incorrectly formatted
    When processing shipment dates
    Then null or incorrect dates should be skipped in calculations
    And a log entry should be recorded for skipped entries

  Scenario: Handle inconsistent cancellation flags
    Given cancellation_flag can have various values
    When processing cancellation flags
    Then only 'Yes', 'yes', or 'YES' should be considered valid cancellation flags
    And other values should be treated as 'No'

  Scenario: Handle missing or mismatched client IDs
    Given shipments may have missing or mismatched client IDs
    When joining shipment data with clients table
    Then exclude records with unmatched client IDs from the output
    And log these records for review

  Scenario: Include only complete shipments
    Given shipments can be partial or pending
    When calculating total shipments
    Then only completed shipments should be included

  Scenario Outline: Calculate statistics with varying data
    Given clients and shipments data is available
    When processing data for <client_name> in <year> and <month>
    Then calculate total <total_shipments>, cancelled <cancelled_shipments>, and cancellation percentage <cancellation_percentage> 
    Examples:
      | client_name | year | month | total_shipments | cancelled_shipments | cancellation_percentage |
      | Client A    | 2023 | 01    | 100             | 10                  | 10.0                    |
      | Client B    | 2023 | 02    | 200             | 40                  | 20.0                    |
